      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "At this point, I think it would make more sense to rely on Proton, and just iron out whatever bugs pop up through Proton. Better yet, the VRC devs should pick out a Proton version they want to officially support and patch the game accordingly to iron out bugs that occur in that particular Proton version.",
