        "like": 3
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat works very well on the latest Proton Experimental. The only thing I've found not to work is the youtube-dl.exe (video-players) and the the whole unity-editor side of things (hopefully they'll choose a more supported version next time they jump editor-versions).\nThe video not working is kind of a tease knowing there's a native version youtube-dl available for linux, but it's simply not worked into vrchat. It would really be the cherry on top if they could do a simple \"IF linux then use youtube-dl NOT youtube-dl.exe\" somewhere in the code, I suspect that's all that's needed considering the sourcecode for that component is the same.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "61b01acd8c8b526a460d1a1f",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5bf14d69b146880205a1f304",
        "alias": "Deep Cheetah",
        "aliasID": "65c287a4ed6eefce4c6c0a07",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/96e9a851c00d23a72c8da42f64dac3ca.png",
        "created": "2018-11-18T11:30:49.700Z",
        "name": "AuroraNemoia",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "tripingpc"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
